      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Mitch and his team were excellent.  Mitch went through everything with us going over our site and explaining why and where we should put our panels.  Everyone else we spoke to was more then happy to quote site unseen. Which was one of the first things you said never never go with someone who doesn't visit your site. Mitch checked our site and once he did he said the panels could not go on the north or West as we were recommended but everyone else.  We have too many trees shading those areas.  We went with east which has no shade until afternoon.  After install Mitch was able to show us we are actually still generating  sun power on our East facing Panels even at 3pm where as our western side was already in full shade.  If we went with the cheaper mob who did not come out to our site we would have wasted our money as our solar panels would have only had a couple of hours sun.Mitch also explained what we needed to do next once install was completed to get our provider to setup our grid connection and how best to take advantage of our solar power once connected to the grid.We highly recommend Mitch and his team helpful, clean, on time and he knows what he is doing.Greg.",
